  "description": "Planning application for:\n-Excavation and enlargement of the existing basement, including structural underpinning of the walls and formation of light wells to the front and side of the house.\n-Demolition of the existing rear extension and construction of a new single-storey rear extension.\n-Minimal reconfiguration of internal layouts.\n-Creation of a roof terrace to the rear, accessed via proposed French doors replacing existing sash windows and a new proposed door from the study.\n-Creation of opening for the new proposed door from the study onto the roof terrace.\n-Removal of the existing dormer and replacement with a wider dormer on the rear elevation.\n-Replacement of all single-glazed windows with timber-frame, double-glazed conservation-style windows.\n-Removal of fireplaces and chimney breasts across all floors.\n-Removal of the chimney stack at the rear of the property.\n-Installation of conservation-style rooflights on the side slope of the main roof above the bathroom.\n-Replacement of three small rooflights with one larger conservation-style rooflight above the staircase.\n-Installation of PV solar panels and an air conditioning unit on the flat roof, with an access hatch for maintenance.\n-Replacement of the timber boundary fence in the rear garden.\n-Erection of timber bin store to front garden",
